description:
El Lissitzy is an international project designed by the union of 15 italian artists:  a pure tribute to Lazar 'Markovic Lisickij (Poéinok 1890 - Moscow 1941), one of the most fervent interpreters of the artistic culture of the first half of the twentieth century: painter, photographer, architect, typographer, designer of the Russian avant-garde.

3000 one of a kind artworks are individually signed and minted on the Ethereum Blockchain, generated on different bases of hand painted canvas, where different levels of art are added, individual traits mixing geometrical design and suprematic art subjects, musical instruments and dancers, finally blended with original songs.

These NFT artworks took part in the international art exhibition held in Belaur in the Russian Avantgarde Museum, together with more than 100 international artists selected for their art posters, book design, objects and sculptures, tribute for the 130th El Lissitzky's anniversary.

Holders will receive these exclusive benefits as an extra utility:

- high quality artwork (50x50cm 300 dpi);
- 1 original song in wav format;
- full album discount;
- lifetime membership to our Italian Design Institute Job Formazione, including a 15% discount on any course plus regular free courses;
- exclusive events for the holders, parties in Italy;
- regular giveaways, contests and airdrops for holders;
- final lottery with a total prize of 2000 Usd.

To receive your holder's benefits, just contact us and write your eth purchase wallet addess: tokennonfungibili@gmail.com

Follow us and the exhibition in the official channels: https://linktr.ee/ellissitzky
